    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just not that simple though. resources and hope don't really fix the fact that i've ruined everything. i look at my life and i don't see a path forward, i just see a giant circle of stress and debt that never ends. it feels like i'm just running in place until i collapse. how is any of that actually supposed to change?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
